              "content": "# Support boundary project\n\nThis project demonstrates supported and runtime-dependent Eve filesystem surfaces.\n",
              "digest": "sha256:4cfd33611157a9832ebbcac72c74f3d7e4b56c2951bca42321b11e240ff0283e",
              "path": "/moldea/project.md",
